      "id": "paragraph-doc-14-2",
      "definition_id": "paragraph-doc",
      "parameters": {
        "text": "# View & Select\n\nSelect the DIC ROI on the reference image (bottom view) and the extraction line on the reference image (top view). Keep the line inside the valid subset-centre mesh, inset from the ROI boundary by at least half a subset. Negate Y remains enabled for line extraction."
      },
