        "y": -548.6305653065917
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "paragraph-doc-14-3",
      "definition_id": "paragraph-doc",
      "parameters": {
        "text": "# Mesh Creation for the extraction"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 929.0334842653347,
        "y": -517.6972733172815
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "paragraph-doc-14-4",
      "definition_id": "paragraph-doc",
      "parameters": {
        "text": "# Subset DIC with pyvale\n\nUses pyvale.dic.calculate_2d with ZNSSD, affine subsets and an automatic bottom-left seed (inset from the ROI edges). Defaults: subsetSize=21 (odd pixels), subsetStep=10, maxDisplacement=10, threshold=0.9 (minimum correlation score). Smaller subsets/steps increase spatial resolution and cost.\n\nResults stay in memory; no DIC files are written. Failed subsets are excluded; cells require four valid adjacent centres. U0 is horizontal displacement; U1 is upward displacement in negative-Y mesh space. v_image preserves downward-positive image displacement. All displacements are in pixels.\n\nReference: https://computer-aided-validation-laboratory.github.io/pyvale/examples/dic/ex04_dic_challenge.html"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 976.0347562613379,
        "y": 10.19551708860297
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "paragraph-doc-14-5",
      "definition_id": "paragraph-doc",
      "parameters": {
        "text": "# Transfer DIC fields onto the line\n\nInterp/Clamp is retained from the Pyxel workflow. It clamps outside the mesh and can interpolate near holes; do not interpret those values as additional correlation measurements. Keep your extraction line inside a connected valid region."
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 1553.3466979568352,
        "y": -576.4234762456965
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "paragraph-doc-14-6",
      "definition_id": "paragraph-doc",
      "parameters": {
        "text": "# Output \n\n- (top) Extracted data using the line\n- (bottom) Raw mesh visualisation"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 2168.9010206000266,
        "y": -530.5142872491945
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "paragraph-doc-14-7",
      "definition_id": "paragraph-doc",
      "parameters": {
        "text": "# Optional output into a file\n\nConnect a writer to export the data into a file\n\n- A Write Table to export a csv\n- A Write Mesh to export a mesh file for desktop visualisation (i.e. ParaView)"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 2893.423110813045,
        "y": -546.2123048186515
      }
    },
    {
