        "text": "# Local Python backend\n\nStart a backend with the tested pyvale version and your image workspace:\n\n```bash\nuvx --with pyvale==2026.11.0 --python 3.14 flowgraph serve --workspace workspace_folder/\n```\n\nConnect via Run → Python Backend using the server address/token. The backend needs FlowGraph, Muscat, NumPy and pyvale. No image downloads or result-file writes are performed by this workflow."
      },
      "position": {
